{"id":"e8b9ce000bccc858","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTEval.md","title":"FTEval","display":"FTEval","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FTEval","parameters":["F","f","D","I","e","t","v"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FTEval"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>f</span><span>D</span><span>I</span><span>e</span><span>t</span><span>v</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶集合语义。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>D</code>、<code>I</code>、<code>e</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>v</code>。</p>\n<p>固定结构与赋值下的项求值表；结构良构由外层 FModel 约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FTEval F f D I e t v)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1412 (@ FTEvalProof F f D I e t v z1412))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"114d382a71fb9ea5\" href=\"?note=114d382a71fb9ea5\" title=\"ZFC_FTEvalProof\">FTEvalProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FTEval F f D I e t v)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTEvalProof","status":"resolved","id":"114d382a71fb9ea5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FTEvalProof|FTEvalProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":836,"backlinks":[{"id":"b7e69cae674ee491","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTEval|FTEval]]"},{"id":"9398adaa58c37efb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FSemRow|FSemRow]]；[[ZFC_FTEval|FTEval]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]；[[ZFC_Update|Update]]"},{"id":"84b5c74b13d9fb18","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FTEval|FTEval]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_SAll|SAll]]；[[ZFC_SModel|SModel]]；[[ZFC_SRelVar|SRelVar]]；[[ZFC_SSemRow|SSemRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]；[[ZFC_Update|Update]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-414","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_FTEval|FTEval]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","114d382a71fb9ea5","593f9bdab4d60707"]}